# TypeScript

- Enable strict typing (do not weaken `tsconfig` strict flags).
- Avoid `any`.
- Prefer interfaces/types for API contracts.
- Do not duplicate models — one canonical definition per contract.

Full detail: `.agent/rules/typescript.md`
